Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         adaptation-sony-pdx206-configs,
         lxc-android,
         mobile-broadband-provider-info,
         ofono-binder-plugin-ext-qti,
         ofono-configs-binder-common,
Description: Sony Xperia 5 II (pdx206) settings on top of the Droidian adaptation
 Dual SIM and IMS/VoLTE in oFono, IMS daemons left enabled in the Android
 container, APN database from Sony's stock firmware, no IPv6 default route
 over rmnet, a stable wlp1s0 name, and no cgroup v1 cpuset mount (the
 kernel's cpuset lives in cgroup v2).
